WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
The first standing heavy punch connects as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.950
The heavy-punch target follow-up connects as the second hit.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.050
OD Rond-point launches Ryu from close range.

4
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.350
Manon spends one Super stock on Level 1.

5
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.000
Level 1 continues the juggle.

6
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.300
Both characters recover after the Level 1 finish.
